{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35636","headline":"山中览刘书记新诗 · 李山甫","name":"山中览刘书记新诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"记室新诗相寄我，蔼然清绝更无过。\n溪风满袖吹骚雅，岩瀑无时滴薜萝。\n云外山高寒色重，雪中松苦夜声多。\n静酬嘉唱对幽景，苍鹤羸栖古木柯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李山甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35636.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35636","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}